{"steam_appid":1999360,"steam_name":"Placid Plastic Duck Simulator","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1999360/466410/d6c6c2e3cd872dcfdee1190b9331e04724bc7dff/1750744239/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1653636571","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256888518/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1653636571","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1999360/ss_12145e842102865c456f54b70c84589556636e6f.1920x1080.jpg?t=1773217106","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1999360/0bc9df8e3b2f5983e1a4bded6b029ff952900423/ss_0bc9df8e3b2f5983e1a4bded6b029ff952900423.1920x1080.jpg?t=1773217106","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1999360/ss_24b40274999fe5f66d207e72ecae0c7428dc8c2a.1920x1080.jpg?t=1773217106","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1999360/ss_2724d72385446588e6d3b0510324235c2c757a9a.1920x1080.jpg?t=1773217106","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1999360/ss_8586d120bc6fdd3ee0eb74734524ae157996d9d4.1920x1080.jpg?t=1773217106"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A relaxing 3D environment where you experience life as a rubber duck, <strong>Placid Plastic Duck Simulator</strong> is an experiment to induce calm and bliss. You're up for a reinvigorating stay at your favorite seaside pool.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are not alone. Different ducks will slowly and happily fall into the pool with you, each with their own style and demeanor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Float on the water, sunbathe, dip your beak, go down the slide. The radio is playing a nostalgic tune.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here comes the night. Look at the stars. Turn off the radio, listen to the waves in the dark. Dream.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The sun is rising. The sky is blue. Slide down into the second pool.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An airplane is rushing somewhere, there's stuff to do.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1999360/extras/dbfa357763c7c7a2193d2b48b7e6aef3.poster.avif?t=1773217106\" width=660 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1999360/extras/dbfa357763c7c7a2193d2b48b7e6aef3.webm?t=1773217106\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1999360/extras/dbfa357763c7c7a2193d2b48b7e6aef3.mp4?t=1773217106\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Live in the present moment, enjoy life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything is going to be alright.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURE LIST</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 2 pools</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 50 different floating ducks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- special events</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- relaxing music</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- day and night cycle</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 15 achievements</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 1 UFO</p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> core i3<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 680<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> core i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 960<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space</li></ul>","genres":["Casual","Simulation"],"developers":["turbolento games"],"publishers":["turbolento publishing","Team17"],"release_date":"6 Jul, 2022"}